<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP SAYS NO OPEN MARKET OPERATIONS.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP SAYS NO OPEN MARKET OPERATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>refrained from staging any open market operations on Monday,</p>
<p>the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
